<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Open Source Licenses — Mortgage Calculator</title>
    <meta name="description" content="License text for every open-source component Mortgage Calculator is built from.">
    <link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1720">
    <style>
        :root { color-scheme: dark; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #0f1720;
            color: #e6edf3;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }
        main { max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 20px 80px; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 36px 0 8px; }
        h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 28px 0 4px; }
        h4 { font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #9fb0c2; font-weight: 600; }
        p, li { color: #c6d2df; }
        a { color: #7ee787; }
        .updated { color: #8b9bad; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 32px; }
        .licenses-overview, .licenses-list, .license-used-by {
            list-style-type: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .note { color: #9fb0c2; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .licenses-overview li { display: inline-block; margin: 0 12px 6px 0; }
        .license-used-by li { display: inline-block; margin: 0 10px 4px 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .license { border-top: 1px solid #223; padding-top: 4px; }
        /* The license texts are long and there are dozens of them; a scroll
           box keeps the page navigable without hiding anything. `pre-wrap`
           matters more than it looks — these texts are hard-wrapped at 80
           columns, which overflows a 375px phone without it. */
        .license-text {
            max-height: 240px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            background: #131c26;
            border: 1px solid #223;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            color: #c6d2df;
        }
        footer { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #223; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main>
        <h1>Open Source Licenses</h1>
        <p class="updated">Generated by <code>cargo about</code> from this app's own dependency graph.</p>

        <p>
            Mortgage Calculator is built from open-source software. Most of it
            is compiled into the WebAssembly engine your browser downloads,
            which makes that file a binary distribution of every project
            listed below — and their licenses ask that their copyright notices
            travel with it. This page is where those notices travel. Nothing
            here is a network service; none of it sees the figures you type.
        </p>

        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <ul class="licenses-overview">
            {{#each overview}}
            <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
            {{/each}}
        </ul>

        <h2>Full license text</h2>
        <p class="note">
            A license appears once per distinct copyright notice, so the same
            license shows up several times with a different "Used by" list
            each time — that repetition is the point, since it is the
            copyright lines, not the license body, that each project asks to
            have carried.
        </p>
        <ul class="licenses-list">
            {{#each licenses}}
            <li class="license">
                <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
                <h4>Used by:</h4>
                <ul class="license-used-by">
                    {{#each used_by}}
                    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
                <pre class="license-text">{{text}}</pre>
            </li>
            {{/each}}
        </ul>

        <footer>
            <a href="./">&larr; Back to the calculator</a>
            &nbsp;·&nbsp;
            <a href="privacy.html">Privacy policy</a>
        </footer>
    </main>
</body>

</html>
